## 3.1 DTOs

📁 `SmartFactory.Application/Reports/Dtos`

```csharp
public class InventoryDto
{
    public int ProductID { get; set; }
    public string MaCai { get; set; }
    public string TenSP { get; set; }
    public int TonKho { get; set; }
}

public class ProductionReportDto
{
    public string MaLsxGc { get; set; }
    public string TenSP { get; set; }
    public int SlgXuatGC { get; set; }
    public int SlgNhapGC { get; set; }
}
